  "description": "NIWMAJ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C115 H135 Gd10 N25 O58 4+,4(Cl1 1-),7(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd9 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd1 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd10 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.704-3.927 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.77-114.51°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd10(L)5(μ2-OH)6(H2O)22](Cl)4·7H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 22 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
